==English==

===Etymology===
From the expression ''the [[early bird catches the worm]]''.

===Noun===
{{rfc-xphrase|Noun phrase}}
'''[[early]] [[bird]]'''

# One who [[wake]]s [[early]], starts early, presumably gets up before the [[rooster]].

